Who We Are

VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&nbsp; Human First philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&nbsp;

VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world's leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&nbsp;

For more information, please visit&nbsp; www.vml.com and follow along on   LinkedIn &nbsp;#WeAreVML.

ABOUT US

&nbsp;

The&nbsp; WPP l Ford Team &nbsp;is an integrated operating network made up of a dynamic multi-agency ecosystem that serves Ford Motor Company and its many diverse units around the world.&nbsp;This operating team provides a breadth of marketing experience for Ford across Communications, Marketing, Brand and Customer Experience, A.I., Creative, Production, Media, Strategy, Analytics, Commerce &amp; Technology and more.&nbsp;

Operated under a central leadership team, it draws best-in-class talent from leading WPP agencies including VML (Brand &amp; Customer Experience), WPP Media (Media), GTB (Precision Retail Marketing), WPP Production (Brand Design &amp; Production), Zubi &amp; UWG (Multicultural), and Burson (Corporate Communications/ Public Relations), among other key WPP specialists. WPP l Ford team members work in a highly integrated environment, with direct exposure across virtually every discipline of modern marketing.&nbsp;

This role is imbedded within &nbsp;VML &nbsp;agency as part of the WPP network. At VML, we are a beacon of innovation and growth in an ever-evolving world. Our heritage is built upon a century of combined expertise, where creativity meets technology, and diverse perspectives ignite inspiration.&nbsp;

